@startuml
title P1 Windows microphone capture engine - production ownership

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor User

component "Windows shell\n(later integration task)" as Shell
component "WindowsMicrophoneCaptureService\nserial reservation + hard limits" as Service
component "Recording cue player" as Cue
component "Local main-program Gain" as Gain
component "Native Windows backend\nCGO-free dynamic loader" as Backend
component "pulsar-capture.dll\nAppCapability + WASAPI" as Native
database "App-private capture store\npartial -> durable_unsent draft" as Store
component "Local RMS meter\n(no samples)" as Meter

User --> Shell : explicit Record / Stop
Shell --> Service : Start(explicit=true) / lifecycle stop
Service --> Cue : start before Open\nstop after Finalize
Service --> Gain : duck / restore
Service --> Backend : permission, resolve, open, read, stop
Backend --> Native : frozen helper ABI
Native --> Backend : native float frames\ntyped terminal reason
Service --> Store : 48 kHz mono PCM16\natomic promotion
Service --> Meter : scalar 0...1

note bottom of Service
180 seconds and 50 MiB hard limits.
Cancel, quit, lock, suspend, device loss,
revocation and backend failure delete partials.
No network or upload dependency.
end note

note bottom of Native
Physical Windows 10/11, permission UI,
hidden capture and device/lifecycle evidence
belong to EPIC-260714-th54l3.
end note

@enduml
